"1223\" data-start=\"1128\"><strong data-end=\"1158\" data-start=\"1130\">Fast &amp; Reliable Shipping</strong> &ndash; Efficient delivery services to ensure customer satisfaction.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1313\" data-start=\"1224\"><strong data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1226\">High Conversion Rate</strong> &ndash; Engaging product pages and promotions help maximize sales.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1397\" data-start=\"1314\"><strong data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1316\">Trusted Brand</strong> &ndash; A growing e-commerce brand with positive customer feedback.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1399\"><strong data-end=\"1431\" data-start=\"1403\">Affiliate Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1760\" data-start=\"1434\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1521\" data-start=\"1434\"><strong data-end=\"1456\" data-start=\"1436\">Commission Rate:</strong> Earn <strong data-end=\"1494\" data-start=\"1462\">competitive commission rates</strong> on each successful sale starting at 15% and you have the chance of going upto 25%</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1638\" data-start=\"1522\"><strong data-end=\"1545\" data-start=\"1524\">Payment Schedule:</strong> Payouts are processed <strong data-end=\"1579\" data-start=\"1568\">monthly</strong> via<strong data-end=\"1635\" data-start=\"1584\">&nbsp;bank transfer</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1760\" data-start=\"1639\"><strong data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1641\">Cookie Duration:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1662\">30-day tracking cookie</strong> ensures you get credit for sales made within a month of the referral.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1790\" data-start=\"1762\"><strong data-end=\"1788\" data-start=\"1766\">Other Information:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2231\" data-start=\"1791\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1919\" data-start=\"1791\"><strong data-end=\"1817\" data-start=\"1793\">Marketing Materials:</strong> Affiliates get access to <strong data-end=\"1895\" data-start=\"1843\">product images, and promotio